cdk-nag-output.txt
**/bin/
**/lib/
**/node_modules/
**/test/
!claude-code-on-lambda-microvm/**/test/
!claude-code-on-lambda-microvm/**/test/**
# The Claude Apps Gateway CDK app keeps its TypeScript SOURCE in bin/ lib/ test/
# (not build output), so the generic **/bin/ **/lib/ **/test/ rules above must not
# swallow it. Un-ignore those source dirs explicitly, then re-ignore the tsc
# build output (.js / .d.ts) that lands beside the .ts source.
!claude-apps-gateway/cdk/bin/
!claude-apps-gateway/cdk/bin/**
!claude-apps-gateway/cdk/lib/
!claude-apps-gateway/cdk/lib/**
!claude-apps-gateway/cdk/test/
!claude-apps-gateway/cdk/test/**
claude-apps-gateway/cdk/bin/**/*.js
claude-apps-gateway/cdk/bin/**/*.d.ts
claude-apps-gateway/cdk/lib/**/*.js
claude-apps-gateway/cdk/lib/**/*.d.ts
claude-apps-gateway/cdk/test/**/*.js
claude-apps-gateway/cdk/test/**/*.d.ts
**/.next/
**/__pycache__/
mkdocs-env/*
.graphqlconfig.yml
**/share/
**/etc/
.env
docs/**/images/
!docs/images/
